{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the world of Tyto\u00a0- a visually stunning platformer featuring hand-painted artwork and a breathtaking soundtrack, composed by the developer himself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.poster.avif?t=1762546986\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.webm?t=1762546986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.mp4?t=1762546986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Yali</strong>, a young owlet lost in a vast forest ruled by fearsome vultures. Rescued and raised by mice, he becomes part of their rebellion, bringing a unique advantage - the power of flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.poster.avif?t=1762546986\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.webm?t=1762546986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.mp4?t=1762546986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through the treetops, uncover hidden secrets, and embark on a journey to reunite with your family while fighting to free the forest from vulture tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.poster.avif?t=1762546986\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.webm?t=1762546986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.mp4?t=1762546986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579340?t=1762546986","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/3b2d440ff200e641777f9a393cd2078b88e22bfd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762546986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/4c9af0315fa8517d340f6b0ee7c51f85fd686f67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762546986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/4c9af0315fa8517d340f6b0ee7c51f85fd686f67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762546986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the world of Tyto\u00a0- a visually stunning platformer featuring hand-painted artwork and a breathtaking soundtrack, composed by the developer himself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"b